   Treating domain-specific language (whether mythology, alchemical flows, or UI components) as merely "surface rendering" rather than core architecture protects the system from domain-lock. It isolates the invariants—causal flow, state boundaries, memory limits—from representation noise.
 * Dynamic Compression & Pruning:
   The inclusion of an explicit pruning operator (\mathcal{K}_\delta) solves the unbounded context problem. Without active garbage collection/entropy pruning, cognitive systems degrade under memory leaks or noise saturation.
Where It Risk Falsification (The Critical Bottlenecks)
